<title>SINGAPORE: Keppel Land acquires S$262.2 mln site.</title>
<headline>Keppel Land acquires S$262.2 mln site.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Keppel Land Ltd, part of the Keppel Corp group, said on Friday it had acquired a site in a prime Singapore residential district for Singapore $262.2 million.  </p>
<p>Keppel said the 12,164 sq m freehold site has a plot ratio of 2.8. An outline provisional permission for a 30-storey condominium development has been approved.</p>
<p>Executive director Kevin Wong said in a statement the acquisition would boost the company's landbank and the timing of site development would depend on market conditions.</p>
<p>- Singapore NEwsroom 65-8703080</p>
